            <trans-unit id="plugin.table" approved="yes"><source>Pricing table</source><target>Cenovna tabela</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plugin.table.description" approved="yes"><source>Plan cards, comparison table or compact rows from one pricing table record.</source><target>Kartice paketov, primerjalna tabela ali kompaktne vrstice iz enega zapisa cenovne tabele.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tab.general" approved="yes"><source>General</source><target>Splošno</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tab.plans" approved="yes"><source>Plans</source><target>Paketi</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tab.attributes" approved="yes"><source>Features</source><target>Funkcije</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tab.prices" approved="yes"><source>Prices</source><target>Cene</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tab.highlight" approved="yes"><source>Highlight</source><target>Poudarek</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.title" approved="yes"><source>Title</source><target>Naslov</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.description" approved="yes"><source>Introductory note</source><target>Uvodna opomba</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.description.hint" approved="yes"><source>Shown above the prices in every layout, e.g. “All prices per month, plus VAT.”</source><target>Prikazano nad cenami v vsaki postavitvi, npr. „Vse cene na mesec, plus DDV.“</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxMode" approved="yes"><source>Entered amounts are</source><target>Vneseni zneski so</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxMode.hint" approved="yes"><source>Defines how the entered amounts are read. Conversion only runs from net to gross, never the other way round.</source><target>Določa, kako se preberejo vneseni zneski. Pretvorba poteka samo iz neto v bruto, nikoli obratno.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxMode.net" approved="yes"><source>Net prices</source><target>Neto cene</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxMode.gross" approved="yes"><source>Gross prices</source><target>Bruto cene</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxRate" approved="yes"><source>Tax rate in percent</source><target>Davčna stopnja v odstotkih</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxRate.hint" approved="yes"><source>Basis for the gross display. 0 skips the conversion.</source><target>Osnova za prikaz bruto zneska. 0 preskoči pretvorbo.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxSwitchable" approved="yes"><source>Visitors may switch between net and gross</source><target>Obiskovalci lahko preklapljajo med neto in bruto</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxSwitchable.hint" approved="yes"><source>Unchecked, the page only shows the option selected above.</source><target>Če ni označeno, stran prikaže samo zgoraj izbrano možnost.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.currencySwitchable" approved="yes"><source>Currency switchable</source><target>Preklop valute</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.currencySwitchable.hint" approved="yes"><source>The switch only appears if more than one currency is entered for the plans.</source><target>Preklop se prikaže samo, če je za pakete vnesenih več valut.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.periodSwitchable" approved="yes"><source>Billing period switchable</source><target>Preklop obračunskega obdobja</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.periodSwitchable.hint" approved="yes"><source>The switch only appears if more than one period is entered for the plans.</source><target>Preklop se prikaže samo, če je za pakete vnesenih več obdobij.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.currencyPosition" approved="yes"><source>Currency symbol</source><target>Simbol valute</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.currencyPosition.hint" approved="yes"><source>English usually puts it before the amount (“€ 99”), German and most continental European languages after it (“99 €”).</source><target>Angleščina ga običajno postavi pred znesek („€ 99“), nemščina in večina celinskih evropskih jezikov pa za njim („99 €“).</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.currencyPosition.before" approved="yes"><source>before the amount (€ 99)</source><target>pred zneskom (€ 99)</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.currencyPosition.after" approved="yes"><source>after the amount (99 €)</source><target>za zneskom (99 €)</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.selectLabel" approved="yes"><source>Button label</source><target>Oznaka gumba</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.selectLabel.hint" approved="yes"><source>Applies to all plans without a label of their own. Empty means “Select”.</source><target>Velja za vse pakete brez lastne oznake. Prazno pomeni „Izberi“.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.selectLabel.placeholder" approved="yes"><source>Select</source><target>Izberi</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.plans" approved="yes"><source>Plans</source><target>Paketi</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.groups" approved="yes"><source>Feature groups</source><target>Skupine funkcij</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.groups.hint" approved="yes"><source>Features belong to the table, not to a single plan — that is the only way the comparison table compares like with like.</source><target>Funkcije pripadajo tabeli, ne posameznemu paketu — to je edini način, da primerjalna tabela primerja primerljivo.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.title" approved="yes"><source>Name</source><target>Ime</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.subtitle" approved="yes"><source>Subtitle</source><target>Podnaslov</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.subtitle.hint" approved="yes"><source>One line below the name, e.g. “6 job ads for 30 days each”.</source><target>Ena vrstica pod imenom, npr. „6 oglasov za delo po 30 dni vsak“.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.eyebrow" approved="yes"><source>Eyebrow</source><target>Nadnaslov</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.eyebrow.hint" approved="yes"><source>Small line above the name, e.g. “48 resources included”.</source><target>Majhna vrstica nad imenom, npr. „Vključenih 48 virov“.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.description" approved="yes"><source>Description</source><target>Opis</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.favourite" approved="yes"><source>Highlight</source><target>Poudarek</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.favourite.hint" approved="yes"><source>The plan gets a border and shadow in the accent colour, and a tinted column in the comparison table.</source><target>Paket dobi obrobo in senco v poudarjeni barvi ter obarvan stolpec v primerjalni tabeli.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.badge" approved="yes"><source>Badge text</source><target>Besedilo značke</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.badge.hint" approved="yes"><source>Empty omits the badge. Common are “Popular” or “Recommended”.</source><target>Če je prazno, značka ni prikazana. Pogosto sta „Priljubljeno“ ali „Priporočeno“.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.badge.placeholder" approved="yes"><source>Popular</source><target>Priljubljen</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.selectLink" approved="yes"><source>Select button target</source><target>Cilj gumba za izbiro</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.selectLink.hint" approved="yes"><source>Without a link no button is rendered — neither an empty one nor a placeholder.</source><target>Brez povezave gumb ni upodobljen — niti prazen niti nadomestni.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.selectLabel" approved="yes"><source>Own label</source><target>Lastna oznaka</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.selectLabel.hint" approved="yes"><source>Overrides the label from the pricing table, for this plan only.</source><target>Preglasi oznako iz cenovne tabele, samo za ta paket.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.priceNote" approved="yes"><source>Note below the price</source><target>Opomba pod ceno</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.priceNote.hint" approved="yes"><source>E.g. “billed annually” or “excl. VAT”.</source><target>Npr. „obračunano letno“ ali „brez DDV“.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.prices" approved="yes"><source>Prices</source><target>Cene</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.attributeValues" approved="yes"><source>Feature values</source><target>Vrednosti funkcij</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.attributeValues.hint" approved="yes"><source>Features without a value count as not included and show a dash. Not every cell has to be filled.</source><target>Funkcije brez vrednosti štejejo kot nevključene in prikažejo pomišljaj. Ni treba izpolniti vsake celice.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.currency" approved="yes"><source>Currency</source><target>Valuta</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.period" approved="yes"><source>Period</source><target>Obdobje</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.period.month" approved="yes"><source>per month</source><target>na mesec</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.period.year" approved="yes"><source>per year</source><target>na leto</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.period.once" approved="yes"><source>one-time</source><target>enkratno</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.period.custom" approved="yes"><source>custom</source><target>po meri</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.unitLabel" approved="yes"><source>Own unit</source><target>Lastna enota</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.unitLabel.hint" approved="yes"><source>E.g. “per ad” or “per calendar”.</source><target>Npr. „na oglas“ ali „na koledar“.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.amount" approved="yes"><source>Amount</source><target>Znesek</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.onRequest" approved="yes"><source>Price on request</source><target>Cena na povpraševanje</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.onRequestLabel" approved="yes"><source>Text instead of the amount</source><target>Besedilo namesto zneska</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.onRequestLabel.hint" approved="yes"><source>Empty means “Price on request”.</source><target>Prazno pomeni „Cena na povpraševanje“.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.title" approved="yes"><source>Title</source><target>Naslov</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.layout" approved="yes"><source>Layout</source><target>Postavitev</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.layout.hint" approved="yes"><source>A checklist for yes/no features, value pairs for details such as fees or quotas.</source><target>Kontrolni seznam za funkcije da/ne, pari vrednosti za podrobnosti, kot so pristojbine ali kvote.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.layout.list" approved="yes"><source>Checklist</source><target>Kontrolni seznam</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.layout.pairs" approved="yes"><source>Value pairs</source><target>Pari vrednosti</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.inCard" approved="yes"><source>Show on cards</source><target>Prikaži na karticah</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.inCard.hint" approved="yes"><source>Some groups belong in the comparison table only and would overload the card.</source><target>Nekatere skupine sodijo samo v primerjalno tabelo in bi preobremenile kartico.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.inMatrix" approved="yes"><source>Show in comparison table</source><target>Prikaži v primerjalni tabeli</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.inMatrix.hint" approved="yes"><source>Unchecked, the group is left out of the comparison table.</source><target>Če ni označeno, je skupina izpuščena iz primerjalne tabele.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.attributes" approved="yes"><source>Features</source><target>Funkcije</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.title" approved="yes"><source>Title</source><target>Naslov</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.valueType" approved="yes"><source>Value type</source><target>Vrsta vrednosti</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.valueType.hint" approved="yes"><source>Determines how the cell looks in the comparison table.</source><target>Določa, kako je videti celica v primerjalni tabeli.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.valueType.check" approved="yes"><source>Check or dash</source><target>Kljukica ali pomišljaj</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.valueType.number" approved="yes"><source>Number</source><target>Število</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.valueType.text" approved="yes"><source>Text</source><target>Besedilo</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.valueType.percent" approved="yes"><source>Percent</source><target>Odstotek</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.unit" approved="yes"><source>Unit</source><target>Enota</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.unit.hint" approved="yes"><source>Shown after the value, e.g. “GB” or “users”.</source><target>Prikazano za vrednostjo, npr. „GB“ ali „uporabniki“.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.footnote" approved="yes"><source>Footnote</source><target>Opomba</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.footnote.hint" approved="yes"><source>Shown in small print after the title in the comparison table.</source><target>Prikazano v drobnem tisku za naslovom v primerjalni tabeli.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="value.attribute" approved="yes"><source>Feature</source><target>Funkcija</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="value.included" approved="yes"><source>Included</source><target>Vključeno</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="value.included.hint" approved="yes"><source>Applies to features of the type “Check or dash”.</source><target>Velja za funkcije vrste „Kljukica ali pomišljaj“.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="value.value" approved="yes"><source>Value</source><target>Vrednost</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="value.value.hint" approved="yes"><source>For number, text and percent. E.g. “unlimited”, “up to 48” or “2.1”.</source><target>Za število, besedilo in odstotek. Npr. „neomejeno“, „do 48“ ali „2.1“.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.sheet" approved="yes"><source>Pricing table</source><target>Cenovna tabela</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.table" approved="yes"><source>Pricing table</source><target>Cenovna tabela</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.table.hint" approved="yes"><source>The record holding plans and features. The same table can appear on several pages in different layouts.</source><target>Zapis, ki vsebuje pakete in funkcije. Ista tabela se lahko pojavi na več straneh v različnih postavitvah.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.layout" approved="yes"><source>Layout</source><target>Postavitev</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.layout.hint" approved="yes"><source>Plan cards for a few plans, compact rows from about five, the comparison table for many features.</source><target>Kartice paketov za nekaj paketov, kompaktne vrstice od približno pet, primerjalna tabela za veliko funkcij.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.layout.cards" approved="yes"><source>Plan cards</source><target>Kartice paketov</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.layout.matrix" approved="yes"><source>Comparison table</source><target>Primerjalna tabela</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.layout.groups" approved="yes"><source>Cards with feature groups</source><target>Kartice s skupinami funkcij</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.layout.rows" approved="yes"><source>Compact rows</source><target>Kompaktne vrstice</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.layout.accordion" approved="yes"><source>Cards with expandable details</source><target>Kartice z razširljivimi podrobnostmi</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.showMatrix" approved="yes"><source>Also show comparison table</source><target>Prikaži tudi primerjalno tabelo</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.showMatrix.hint" approved="yes"><source>The comparison table then appears below the chosen layout.</source><target>Primerjalna tabela se nato prikaže pod izbrano postavitvijo.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.collapseMatrix" approved="yes"><source>Comparison table collapsed</source><target>Primerjalna tabela zložena</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.collapseMatrix.hint" approved="yes"><source>The comparison table only opens on click — keeps the page calm with many features.</source><target>Primerjalna tabela se odpre samo ob kliku — stran ostane mirna ob veliko funkcijah.</target></trans-unit>
